# Optional variables; this file is documentation, not loaded automatically.
# PowerShell: $env:ETSY_BROWSER_PATH = 'C:\Program Files\Google\Chrome\Application\chrome.exe'
# The local.py launcher always selects <repo>/data unless --data-dir is explicit.
# An independent profile is created in data/browser-profile; never use your daily profile.
# Chrome uses Windows system proxy by default. Optional explicit proxy:
# ETSY_BROWSER_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:7897
# ETSY_BROWSER_DEBUG_PORT=9238
